    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the market with Bryan Little of RE/MAX Partners, 35 Glendale is an exceptional\r\nsemi-detached home offering a rare combination of generous living space, superb versatility, and highly desirable outdoor features. Boasting a large, attached garage and a fantastic standalone studio apartment, this property presents a unique opportunity for growing families, multi-generational living, or those \r\nseeking a premium work-from-home setup.\r\nMeticulously cared for, Number 35 is a highly adaptable property that is sure to appeal to buyers looking for a home that offers both space and functionality.\r\nInternally, the property is beautifully proportioned with an excellent balance of living and bedroom \r\naccommodation. At the heart of the ground floor is a spacious, traditional kitchen and dining area. This bright, welcoming room features quality solid wood cabinetry, ample counter space, and a lovely dining area—ideal for family meals and easy entertaining. The ground floor also benefits from direct access to the large, attached garage, which offers incredible storage potential or the opportunity for future \r\nconversion (subject to planning). The bedroom accommodation is highly generous, featuring four \r\ngood-sized, bright bedrooms with excellent built-in wardrobe storage. Each room is designed to maximize light and space all served by a well-appointed family bathroom.\r\nTo the rear, the property truly comes into its own. The stunning, sunny rear garden has been beautifully landscaped, featuring a pristine paved patio, lush lawn, and mature bedding. A magnificent, solid-wood standalone pergola covers a raised decking area, creating the ultimate outdoor haven for summer dining and entertaining.\r\nNestled privately in the garden is the detached standalone studio. Fully finished with modern flooring, recessed lighting, this self-contained space is perfect as a home office, gym, or guest studio.\r\nSuperbly located in the mature and highly sought-after development of Glendale, the property is within easy walking distance of Leixlip Village, excellent schools, local shops, and sports clubs. Commuters will find the location incredibly convenient, with superb access to bus routes, nearby train stations, and the M4 motorway.\r\nA unique and highly versatile property throughout—early viewing of this wonderful home is strongly \r\nadvised."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nPORCH: c.1.64 x 0.51m\r\nLight fitting, tiled floor, sliding door.\r\n\r\nHALLWAY: c.1.96 x 4.02m\r\nLight fitting, dado rail, downstairs storage, wooden floor, phone point.\r\n\r\nLOUNGE: c.3.61 x 4.54m\r\nCoving, light fittings, open feature fireplace, TV/cable point, blinds, curtains, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM: c.5.72 x 3.40m\r\nCoving, centre rose, light fittings, fitted units, tiled splash back area, stainless steel sink, area plumbed, TV/cable point, tiled floor, curtains, blinds, door leading to garden area.\r\n\r\nLANDING: c.1.95 x 3.36m\r\nLight fitting, hot press, attic access, blind, carpet.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1: c.3.64 x 3.50m\r\nLight fitting, fitted wardrobes with vanity sink, carpet, blinds, curtains.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2: c.2.91 x 3.86m\r\nLight fittings, fitted wardrobes, blind, carpet.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3: c.2.65 x 2.69m\r\nLight fitting, fitted wardrobes, blind, TV/cable point, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM: c.1.94 x 1.72m\r\nLight fittings, extractor fan, fully tiled, WC, WHB, bath.\r\n\r\nGARAGE: c.2.35 x 4.98m\r\nLight fittings, electric Velux window, concrete floor.\r\n\r\nUTILITY/STORAGE ROOM: c. 2.34 x 3.01m\r\nLight fitting, Velux window, tiled floor, area plumbed.\r\n\r\nSTUDIO: c. 3.18 x 4.56m\r\nLight fittings, fitted wardrobes, wooden floor, TV/cable point, blinds.\r\n\r\nGUEST WC: c.2.03 x 0.84m\r\nLight fitting, wall & floor tiling, WC, WHB."
      },
